# Documentation is NEVER gitignored in this repo.
#
# The audit behind this kit (docs/research/2026-09-11-workspace-doc-audit.md,
# failure class INVISIBLE) found a repo whose entire .gitignore was 11 bytes:
# a blank line and `plan.md` — the repo's only planning artifact, excluded from
# git and therefore invisible to CI, teammates, worktrees and fresh clones.
# Another hid `.local/` and `.claude/`, taking the learning log, the changelog
# and both working plans with them.
#
# Rule 1 of docs/architecture/doc-classes.md: nothing durable is gitignored.
# If a doc is worth writing, it is worth committing. Do not add `*.md`,
# `plan.md`, `docs/`, `.local/` or any notes directory below.

node_modules/

